MEMORY.md:1875:**Completed editorial/display review is not complete historical verification.** Of 805 sources, 691 have scoped supporting-page checks, 78 metadata checks, 9 are marked not checked, and 27 have unrecorded verification. No current roster selection lacks a contextual work string. Some inherited influence claims explicitly need stronger passage/reception evidence. The preserved baseline audit and current enrichment records distinguish source limits from substantive review progress. Tests prove display and structural consistency, not completeness of a canon or historical truth.
