# Revision 1.111: reviewed library bibliography and subject integration

Screened all 1,628 journal candidates and integrated 798 bibliographic profiles using primary-title and own-ISSN concordance. Added identifiers to 786 candidates, language codes to 797 and 545 catalogued title/edition starts; existing better dates remain protected. Source-supported subjects now cover 864 candidates, up from 507: 611 LCSH-supported rows added, 223 corresponding provisional rows archived. Current totals: 799 candidates with ISSNs, 555 with starts, 794 with library headings, 2,006 active classification rows and 304 archived provisional rows. 1,010 candidates have a reviewed profile or source-supported subjects; 552 have profiles with headings and starts. These are field-specific counts, not fully verified profiles.

